WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.240
bottom right of screen. Show text&nbsp;
on screen: SCP-682 VS SCP-1933]&nbsp;

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:07.600
SCP-682 Vs SCP-1933. Who would win? A huge,&nbsp;
hyper-intelligent lizard monster who can&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:11.680
not only adapt to almost any attacks&nbsp;
but also give them back - Or a fat,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:11.680 --> 00:00:14.960
drunk guy dressed as Santa&nbsp;
with Irish cream for blood?

00:00:14.960 --> 00:00:19.760
Though to be fair, this Irish Cream will also&nbsp;
turn your blood into Irish Cream and kill you.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:19.760 --> 00:00:25.520
Foundation researchers siphoned off&nbsp;
200 gallons and fed it to SCP-682.

00:00:25.520 --> 00:00:29.520
682 apparently really enjoyed this,&nbsp;
because it drank literally all of it,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:29.520 --> 00:00:34.080
even becoming intoxicated and collapsing&nbsp;
onto the ground, vocalizing loudly.

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:38.400
Researchers hoped this fluid was&nbsp;
wreaking havoc on 682’s internals,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:43.600
but instead, it vomited up huge quantities of&nbsp;
this anomalous Irish cream, turning the walls of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:49.120
its cell into Irish Cream, and subsequently&nbsp;
escaping to go on another deadly rampage.

